<<baitShopFishBehaviorHelp>>
<<link [[수락한다|Bait Shop Owner Fish Request Response]]>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "requested">>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Bait Shop Owner Fish Request Response]]>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "notToday">>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>



:: Bait Shop Owner Fish Request Response
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "bait_shop_owner">><<person1>>

<<if $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest is "requested">>
	<<He>>【은는】 미소 짓는다. "고마워요! 기대하고 있을게요! 하지만 못 잡더라도 걱정 마세요. 낚시란 게 운이 따라줘야 하니까요. 그 녀석들은 보통 <<baitShopFishLocationHint>>에서 찾을 수 있어요."
<<elseif $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest is "notToday">>
	<<He>>【은는】 어깨를 으쓱한다. "알겠어요. 제가 점심시간에 짬을 내서 직접 잡을 수 있을지 봐야겠네요. 혹시 마음이 바뀌면, 그 녀석들은 보통 <<baitShopFishLocationHint>>에서 찾을 수 있으니 참고하세요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<getouticon>><<link [[밖으로 나간다|Mer Pier]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Fishing Pier Shack Owner Break Catch Help
<<baitShopFishBehaviorHelp>>
<<link [[수락한다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "requested">>
	<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "acceptedFishingRequest">>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Fishing Pier Wait]]>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "notToday">>
	<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "declinedFishingRequest">>
	<<endevent>>
<</link>>
